Based on the search results:
- "AMG Sport Edition" was a trim level on the W204 C-Class (2007-2014).
- It replaced "AMG Sport" and "AMG Sport Plus" on the W204.
- It included AMG styling, sports steering wheel, lowered sports suspension, etc..
- Examples include C220 CDI and C250 CDI AMG Sport Edition.
- There was also an "AMG Sport Edition 125" on the W204.
- The W205 generation (2014-2021) used "AMG Sport" initially (like C450 AMG Sport) before renaming to "AMG C43".
- The W206 generation (2021-present) uses "AMG Line" for the sportier non-AMG models. There is also a "Sport Edition" on the W206 C200 in some markets, but it's not explicitly "AMG Sport Edition".

